Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we landed in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon and I crossed\Nover to another floating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,island where we found Izzy and Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Izzy was busy doing something\Nor other with his computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centarumon, with a black\Ngear stuck in him, attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy somehow started talking to me through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my digivice and led\NTentomon and I to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our little partners digivolved just\Nin time, driving out the black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.98,0:02:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, who was still under\NDevimon's evil control, appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Izzy and I used our digivices\Nand shoot that bad kitty away.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.26,0:02:14.98,Sign,TITLE,0,0,280,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Dancing Ghosts! Bakemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Odoru dore, Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Devimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had completely separated those seven\Nbrats and their pesty Digimon. That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until that Tai and Mimi\Ncaught up with Matt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Izzy. But I'll make\Nsure they never find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their other friends\NEspecially with the plans
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have for Sora and\NJoe on that lovely day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bakemon holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I've\Nlearned in Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beds don't make good boats.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.40,0:03:01.24,Sign,BAG,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,300)}{\a6}[Bag: Emergency supply]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just hear you\Neating again? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to eat all the food\Nsince we don't know when we'll find land?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that we'd need to ration,\Nwhich means to save food for later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as in much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is later, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you told me that 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 minutes is not much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me that there is\Nstill some food in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no, since you can't handle eating\Nand floating on the ocean at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I need food to digivolve\Nin case we run into bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, have we seen any bad Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I starve, who are you going to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough about food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things will get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crate is gonna hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's full of\Nfruit, vegetables, bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,milk, cereal, hot dogs, cookies,\Ncandy, soda. I wish. You wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't need more food\Nif you hadn't eaten ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong when you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starvation is a good motivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll need a\Njackhammer to open this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, you little digi-pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel-whack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel-whack! Pummel-whack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out of the sea, marching fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of some second fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A second thought that really hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What powerful force could\Ncause this evil Digimon to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be driven back and out-muscled\Nby a bunch of small fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the small and meek join\Nforces to fight for a good purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can often bring about the\Ndownfall of the big and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, sometimes\Nthey haven't got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And neither do we!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for you, meeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bigger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's some hand-to-hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a-whacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to climb up on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cowards go ahead and\Nrun see how far you get
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty cats, come back and\Nfight. I dare ya. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh man I don't like adventure I'm a\Nstay at home and read kind of guy huh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired hungry sinking sinking is bad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon hey wait a\Nminute I thought you were
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to be some sort\Nof super water mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sara's fishing, Sara's fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch anything? Not yet. Give me time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:06:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping to catch something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even be happy if you\Ncaught me a little sardine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how hungry you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I caught a huge any kind of fish, you'd\Nbe right there eating it with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since you put it that way, do you\Nreally think you can make a big catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, maybe there's one now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, it feels like a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a whopper for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, that's a person! Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then a large crate drifted over to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon popped out and attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, how horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was, but I did evolve and we escaped\Nhim, but then my strength left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't seem to keep my energy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next thing I knew, I was\Nsinking deeper and deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I opened my eyes and looked\Naround, I finally spotted Joe nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was unconscious at the time and\Nsinking fast. I tried to get him to the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surface But my strength was giving out\Nagain And I knew I couldn't hold my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breath much longer And that's about\Nthe time your fishing line hit me So I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grabbed that line and wrapped it around\NJoe And hung on until you pulled us in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness I'm so\Nglad that the both of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are okay But I'm\Nworried about Joe You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's going to be just fine, Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, physically, but I'm\Nworried about his confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting Ogremon back there\Nreally knocked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to rebuild his self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just make him our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, where's Ogremon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? Huh? He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've got a bigger problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on this deserted\Nisland with no leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess you're going\Nto have to lead us, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm for him. And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me. I am not a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the strongest one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the bravest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember how you fought the Unimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am brave. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the brightest one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's not get too carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but if I fail, who\Nwill save you or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fish line?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it seemed to come from up there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks kind of like a church
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever there's a church,\Nthere's usually people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe our friends Someone\Nshould check it out I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Biyomon, Joe's our leader now? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, lead us What if\Nwe see a bad Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:10:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I need a moment. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hut, two, three, four. Oh, you're left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, three, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must he keep up that\Narmy march drivel? Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Notice anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all looks sort of familiar to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if it's a place I've\Ndreamed about or déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like we've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This definitely looks like the part\Nof the island that broke away Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep So we should find everyone\Nelse or at least some other people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking shelter in that church You're\Nassuming quite a bit there Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's my opinion I'm just giving you\Nanother view I'm the leader here Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Let's move out. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've created a monster. Hey,\Nyou think a black ear got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, step lively now, troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have no stragglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, you're the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to take a peek?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want you taking a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a normal group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, guys! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people in the church\Ndancing badly, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dancing and they're wearing masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like it's Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hallow-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dancing and they're\Nwearing masks like it's Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hallow-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're celebrating the Bakemon holiday he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reminds me of halloween\Nwe'd love to have you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,join us we don't have\Na lot of young people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around and no holiday\Nis complete without them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you arrive just in time for some fun like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trick-or-treat you do\Nthat for Bakemon yes wait
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon as in lord\NBakemon yes but the only
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon i know of is a\Nhorrible digimon who lives
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Among ghosts as their ruler. Why would you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honor and celebrate\Nsomeone like that in the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,words of our friends\Nhe's like a loser you got
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that right don't you\Ndare come in here telling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us who to honor or not\Nnow now back off you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little touchy we just\Nwant to know when the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trick-or-treating starts you're not afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, well, you should be,\Nbecause it's a trick! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Masked Man was the evil\NDigimon Lord Bakemon in disguise.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(236,130)\b1}Bakemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(498,280)}Ghost Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(499,202)}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(495,314)}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(495,337)}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(497,366)}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:30.80,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(498,390)}Hell's Hand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one had ever seen him in his true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, it's the worst in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dancers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who I bet are ghosts, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora's Lister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have saved some earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be-a-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry too. Can't Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.85,0:14:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic I'm allergic to pain Get
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of there. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn. Not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't panic I'm still in\Ncontrol and feeling strong Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be somebody's appetizer\NI'm supposed to go to med school
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pepper. More? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salt and pepper You're not\Nreally going to eat us are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a little on the\Nscrawny side. But you'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surprised what the right\Nseasonings can do You think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can finagle him into\Ndining on someone a bit bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of fiend is\Nthis guy We're just kids
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a way out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we've been looking\Nin all the wrong places
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not much room\Nto look in this place
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be able to trick the guard and\Nescape We may be able to trick him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's a given He\Ndoesn't look too smart Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so first we have to try and wake\Nhim up How are we gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him. For a ghost,\Nhe sleeps like a log.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to get his attention or we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never escape Uh-huh But\NI'm all out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when do you start? Start what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start taunting us, you\Nfloating bag of wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give bad Digimon a bad name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't learned how to\Ntaunt anyone yet. It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just find out what we want,\Nthen don't let us have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's how you taunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're starving and want to eat, so you\Nshow us food, but don't give it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I got a bunch of bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then taunt us with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.53,0:16:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks good, doesn't it? I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come a little closer. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to come even closer to taunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't really see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never get between a Digimon and his meal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to eat me I'm mostly Gristle\Nanyway What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying they should eat me first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, can't you see it's\Ncurtains for both of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, go have your pity party somewhere\Nelse My gingerbread will be a treat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sharing those. We\Nlike to boo. Now it's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to chew on you Now\Nit's time to chew on you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Dixie Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beelon, Digivolve, Beel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spurge-ra-bon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your timing couldn't be\Nbetter. Go get Pagumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor wing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Bakemon is tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I'm the greatest one to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His power comes from evil But I know\Nthat good can beat him with time Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if it's too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never too late to\Nfight evil But we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weaken Lord Bakemon to help\Nour friends prevail We?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the leader, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a quitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what makes you think\Nthat we can beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I once saw a show about\Nthis Roman physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He believed that repeating a phrase\Nhelps you focus mind over matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's focus on running.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we focus on making\NBakemon lose his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're in charge. Start focusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon, lose your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon, lose your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon, lose your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can jump in any time now. Well, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but I don't know if that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just didn't, uh, oh, well,\Nyeah, we'll use my lucky hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon lose your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.09,0:19:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, Bakemon is getting weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon better pick his\Nfights more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a hint! Hit the highway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're not shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, those are black gears!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm sure glad\Nthose black gears broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad Bakuman's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Infinity Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.06,0:20:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe our friends are there, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not all that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a jacket. It's a jacket,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a jacket. It's a\Ndream that I like it. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dream that it's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future is the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that you can see
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.10,0:23:05.00,Sign,Next time on Digimon Adventure,0,0,280,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Adventure! Patamon and I

